        "TileImage": "$($repository 4d0953f0-7f19-4130-abae-610a8f5dddca).Image",
        "Description": "Agent 006 did not survive the Sapienza Operation.  While she managed to destroy the lab after your exfiltration, the viral research remain unrecovered.\r\rMI6 has tracked the virus research to Marrakesh.  Agent 003 was tasked to infiltrate and collect the documents, but has been poisoned by counter-operative disguised as a fortune-teller.\r\rMI6 isssuing a License to Kill on:\rKong Tuo-Kwang - Hong Kong Buyer\rMattheu Mendola - IAGO Agent\rZaki Diab - IAGO Agent\r\rGood luck, 005.",
